Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:07:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] riscv: configs: Add Milk-V Jupiter (K1) + AMD GPU
 defconfigs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

k1_amdgpu_defconfig: everything built in, GPU firmware built in via
CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE from ../linux-firmware; boots without initramfs.

k1_amdgpu_modules_defconfig: distro-style kernel with modules, needs an
initramfs; no firmware is built in, GPU firmware comes from
/lib/firmware.

Signed-off-by: Bas Magré <bas@opvolger.net>
---
