+#
+# Build:   make ARCH=riscv CROSS_COMPILE=riscv64-linux-gnu- k1_amdgpu_defconfig
+#          make ARCH=riscv CROSS_COMPILE=riscv64-linux-gnu- -j$(nproc) Image.gz dtbs
+#
+# The GPU drivers are built in and there is no initramfs, so their firmware
+# is built into the kernel via CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE.  This needs a checkout of
+# linux-firmware next to this tree (CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR="../linux-firmware").
+#
+# USB (DWC3 + K1 USB2 PHY + onboard VL817 hub) is enabled here; without
+# USB_DWC3/USB_DWC3_GENERIC_PLAT/PHY_SPACEMIT_K1_USB2 the USB ports are dead.
